sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant CDN
    participant Origin

    Browser->>CDN: GET /app.js
    alt cache hit
        CDN-->>Browser: 200 OK (from edge)
    else cache miss
        CDN->>Origin: GET /app.js
        Origin-->>CDN: 200 OK
    end
    else stale while revalidate
    CDN-->>Browser: 200 OK (stale)
    end
    Browser->>CDN: GET /app.css
